{{!
    @template local_coursegen/local/courseai/planning_view

    Step 2 of the AI course creation page: the planning view, made of the
    progress area, the completion card and the review area (partials
    planning_progress, planning_completion and planning_review).

    The view is shown with an inline display style when the page resumes a
    session, hidden otherwise; the JavaScript toggles element.style.display on
    it (migrated in a later step).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none (elements are addressed by id)

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isresuming bool - True when the page resumes an existing session

    Example context (json):
    {
        "isresuming": false
    }
}}
<div class="planning-wrap" id="planningView" style="display:{{#isresuming}}flex{{/isresuming}}{{^isresuming}}none{{/isresuming}}">
  {{> local_coursegen/local/courseai/planning_progress }}
  {{> local_coursegen/local/courseai/planning_completion }}
  {{> local_coursegen/local/courseai/planning_review }}
</div>
